{
  "sctemplate": "0.1",
  "meta": {
    "id": "portafolio-verano-template",
    "name": "Portafolio Verano — template",
    "author": "Jesus Hurtado"
  },
  "size": {
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080
  },
  "theme": {
    "colors": {
      "canvas": "#070706",
      "ink": "#8E887C",
      "muted": "#E9E5DC",
      "accent": "#D9A15B",
      "tone-1": "#231F1B"
    },
    "fonts": {
      "display": "Poppins",
      "body": "Poppins",
      "mono": "Sometype Mono"
    },
    "fontFaces": [
      {
        "family": "Poppins",
        "src": "https://mcp.slidecode.app/catalogo/asset/3dc5d0c52428fe1696264907a1054ebbaac07f8cbe45832c105f819c2ae397c0.woff2",
        "weight": 400,
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "family": "Poppins",
        "src": "https://mcp.slidecode.app/catalogo/asset/289e0afc8be731a86822349e54557296f145926496bd2138db1bac0db77f77a2.woff2",
        "weight": 500,
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "family": "Poppins",
        "src": "https://mcp.slidecode.app/catalogo/asset/4ef5511d8e7b39ae3f98ffed14d6071d7914e0c145fee5a79bb43aa962ff0fc4.woff2",
        "weight": 800,
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "family": "Poppins",
        "src": "https://mcp.slidecode.app/catalogo/asset/d1ebe21db0d30b4c6eff465086295804e94f0ae5ec05c47c45b0d602bf180f0f.woff2",
        "weight": 900,
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "family": "Sometype Mono",
        "src": "https://mcp.slidecode.app/catalogo/asset/b0fd50aef6ca5b76a75cd16251c9ab7a367edce9afaabb0c67a53bfd0251a815.woff2",
        "weight": 400,
        "style": "normal"
      }
    ],
    "textStyles": {
      "display": {
        "fontFamily": "$fonts.display",
        "fontSize": 340,
        "fontWeight": 900,
        "lineHeight": 0.84,
        "letterSpacing": -14,
        "color": "$colors.muted",
        "textTransform": "uppercase"
      },
      "h1": {
        "fontFamily": "$fonts.display",
        "fontSize": 120,
        "fontWeight": 800,
        "lineHeight": 0.92,
        "letterSpacing": -3.5,
        "color": "$colors.muted",
        "textTransform": "uppercase"
      },
      "body": {
        "fontFamily": "$fonts.display",
        "fontSize": 26,
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "lineHeight": 1.62,
        "color": "$colors.ink"
      },
      "code": {
        "fontFamily": "$fonts.mono",
        "fontSize": 19,
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "letterSpacing": 1.2,
        "color": "$colors.accent",
        "textTransform": "uppercase"
      },
      "h2": {
        "fontFamily": "$fonts.display",
        "fontSize": 34,
        "fontWeight": 800,
        "lineHeight": 1.15,
        "letterSpacing": -0.4,
        "color": "$colors.muted"
      },
      "caption": {
        "fontFamily": "$fonts.display",
        "fontSize": 17,
        "fontWeight": 500,
        "lineHeight": 1.4,
        "letterSpacing": 2.6,
        "color": "$colors.ink",
        "textTransform": "uppercase"
      }
    }
  },
  "layouts": [
    {
      "id": "cover",
      "name": "Portada",
      "slide": {
        "id": "cover",
        "name": "Portada",
        "background": {
          "type": "solid",
          "color": "$colors.canvas"
        },
        "transition": {
          "type": "fade",
          "duration": 0.6
        },
        "layers": [
          {
            "id": "main",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "cover-title",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 64,
                  "y": 120,
                  "w": 1400,
                  "h": 600
                },
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Porta\nFolio.",
                "styleRef": "$textStyles.display"
              },
              {
                "id": "cover-rule",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 90,
                  "y": 742,
                  "w": 140,
                  "h": 4
                },
                "type": "shape",
                "shape": "rect",
                "fill": {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "$colors.accent"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "cover-meta-1",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 1330,
                  "y": 170,
                  "w": 500,
                  "h": 26
                },
                "type": "text",
                "text": "09 mayo 2026",
                "styleRef": "$textStyles.caption",
                "style": {
                  "align": "right"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "cover-meta-2",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 1330,
                  "y": 206,
                  "w": 500,
                  "h": 120
                },
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Presentación creativa\nPresentado por: Mara Vidal",
                "styleRef": "$textStyles.h2",
                "style": {
                  "fontSize": 30,
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "align": "right"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "cover-lede",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 90,
                  "y": 780,
                  "w": 1180,
                  "h": 120
                },
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dirección de arte y fotografía para marcas que viven al sol. Una selección de trabajo editorial, identidad y campaña realizada entre 2023 y 2026.",
                "styleRef": "$textStyles.body"
              },
              {
                "id": "chrome-mark",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 90,
                  "y": 984,
                  "w": 420,
                  "h": 26
                },
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Estudio Verano",
                "styleRef": "$textStyles.caption",
                "style": {
                  "fontWeight": 800,
                  "letterSpacing": 3.4,
                  "color": "$colors.muted"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "chrome-site",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 760,
                  "y": 984,
                  "w": 400,
                  "h": 26
                },
                "type": "text",
                "text": "estudioverano.com",
                "styleRef": "$textStyles.caption",
                "style": {
                  "align": "center"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "chrome-mail",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 1410,
                  "y": 984,
                  "w": 420,
                  "h": 26
                },
                "type": "text",
                "text": "hola@estudioverano.com",
                "styleRef": "$textStyles.caption",
                "style": {
                  "align": "right"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "builds": [
          {
            "id": "c-b1",
            "trigger": "auto",
            "delay": 0.15,
            "actions": [
              {
                "nodeId": "cover-title",
                "effect": "slideIn",
                "duration": 0.8,
                "delay": 0,
                "easing": "easeOut",
                "direction": "up",
                "distance": 70
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "c-b2",
            "trigger": "auto",
            "delay": 0.7,
            "actions": [
              {
                "nodeId": "cover-meta-1",
                "effect": "fadeIn",
                "duration": 0.45,
                "delay": 0,
                "easing": "easeOut"
              },
              {
                "nodeId": "cover-meta-2",
                "effect": "fadeIn",
                "duration": 0.45,
                "delay": 0.08,
                "easing": "easeOut"
              },
              {
                "nodeId": "cover-rule",
                "effect": "scaleIn",
                "duration": 0.45,
                "delay": 0.16,
                "easing": "easeOut"
              },
              {
                "nodeId": "cover-lede",
                "effect": "fadeIn",
                "duration": 0.5,
                "delay": 0.24,
                "easing": "easeOut"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "notes": "ADN DE MARCA — ESTUDIO VERANO\nMood: portafolio editorial de verano. Negro absoluto, tipografía geométrica descomunal (Poppins Black), fotografía cálida de luz natural como único color. Calma con filo.\nSistema: canvas #070706 · ink #E9E5DC · muted #8E887C · accent #D9A15B (arena, UNO por lámina) · hairline #231F1B.\nTipografía: Poppins 900 para display (ls muy negativo, uppercase), 800 para títulos, 400 para cuerpo. Cargada de verdad en theme.fontFaces.\nGesto distintivo: el display sangra fuera del margen izquierdo; el cromo (kicker arriba-izq, fecha arriba-der, wordmark + contacto abajo) se repite idéntico en todas las láminas y se queda quieto en los morph.\nDO: una sola idea por lámina · 40-70% de aire · foto a sangre por un solo borde · numerales gigantes en accent.\nDON'T: centrar todo · más de un acento · foto con azul saturado · degradados · sombras suaves · íconos.\nFotografía: Unsplash, paleta cálida/neutra (arena, piedra, paja, blanco). Nunca turquesa saturado."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro",
